      zh: "佛告阿難：「如此妙花，是本法藏比丘願力所成，若欲念彼佛者，當先作此妙花座想。作此想時不得雜觀；皆應一一觀之，一一葉，一一珠，一一光，一一臺，一一幢，皆令分明，如於鏡中自見面像。此想成者，滅除五百億劫生死之罪，必定當生極樂世界。作是觀者，名為正觀。若他觀者，名為邪觀。」",
      en: "The Buddha told Ānanda: “Such wondrous flowers are accomplished by the vow-power of the Dharma-store bhikṣu. If one wishes to recollect that Buddha, one should first make this wondrous flower-throne contemplation. When making this contemplation one must not mix other views; each petal, each jewel, each light, each platform, each banner should be contemplated one by one, all clear, as seeing one’s face in a mirror. When this thought is accomplished, fifty billion kalpas of birth-and-death offenses are extinguished; one will surely be born in the Land of Ultimate Bliss. One who does this contemplation is called correct contemplation; one who contemplates otherwise is called wrong contemplation.”"
